<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - July 17.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - July 17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no large one-day net miss in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was about $1.16 billion on Tuesday, while the low in natural float was about $35 million on Friday.</p>
<p>Transportation float averaged about $35 million per day with the high on Thursday at about $135 million primarily due to missed connections from the Texas areas to the Midwest and northeast.</p>
<p>(( -- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
